                                                "sense_id": "3c3da1f0-9a41-32b0-92e4-00d6f3472475",
                                                "text": "These autoimmune diseases can be treated with antibiotics; however diagnoses can be difficult and treatment can lead to side effects such as dysbacteriosis."
